speechtext:
My hon. friend was asking for information; he asked me if it was correct that in 1913 two boats were wrecked. That is true, but it is also true that my hon.
14011-268}
friend might have taken the whole period during which work was going on there, from 1913 to 1918, and the same number were wrecked. That is to say, there were only two wrecks altogether during all the years the work was proceeding.
